sequenceDiagram
    participant L as Left side
    participant R as Right side
    L-|\R: solid top
    L-|/R: solid bottom
    L-\\R: stick top
    L-//R: stick bottom
    L--|\R: dotted solid top
    L--|/R: dotted solid bottom
    L--\\R: dotted stick top
    L--//R: dotted stick bottom
    R-|\L: solid top back
    R--//L: dotted stick bottom back
